# ============================================================
#  Persistent states. A state is something that sticks to the
#  player across months: an origin, a class, a club, a job, an
#  illness, a curse. States can:
#    tick:      run every month start while active
#    duration:  default length in months (omit = until removed)
#    group:     only one state of the same group at a time
#    on_add / on_expire / on_remove: effects
#  Events check them with has(state_id) and left(state_id).
# ============================================================

# ---------------- Origins (chosen at the start) ----------------

@state origin_noble
name: Minor Nobility
kind: origin
group: origin
art: crown
desc: A family name that opens doors, and letters from home that bring money and expectations in the same envelope.
money: Comfortable: 90 crowns to start, and 38 from the family before each later term, now and then with a gift. Every letter weighs on you a little. Tuition is yours to pay.
on_add:
  origin_noble_start
  renown +6

@state origin_scholar
name: Scholarship Student
kind: origin
group: origin
art: scroll
desc: The Crown pays for clever students, for as long as they stay clever.
money: Tight: 60 crowns to start. Before each later term, 38 crowns if last term's GPA was 3.0 or better, 46 at 3.5 or better, and nothing below. Tuition is yours to pay.
on_add:
  origin_scholar_start

@state origin_hedge
name: Hedge-Witch's Grandchild
kind: origin
group: origin
art: mushroom
desc: Raised among drying herbs and muttered charms: a practical hand with potions, and not much patience for theory.
money: Poor: 45 crowns and no money from home. You will need a job from the first term.
tags: poor
on_add:
  origin_hedge_start
  mood +6

@state origin_street
name: Street-Raised
kind: origin
group: origin
art: mask
desc: You learned to read crowds before you learned to read runes.
money: Poor: 38 crowns and no one to send more. You will need a job from the first term.
tags: poor
on_add:
  origin_street_start

@state origin_merchant
name: Merchant's Child
kind: origin
group: origin
art: scales
desc: Everything has a price, and you were taught to haggle it down.
money: Rich but unsteady: 150 crowns to start, and 78 from the company before each later term when trade goes well, about two terms in three; nothing when it doesn't. Tuition is yours to pay.
on_add:
  origin_merchant_start

# ---------------- Electives (one per term) ----------------

@state class_pyromancy
name: Elective: Pyromancy
kind: class
group: elective
art: flame
tags: class
desc: Fire answers to will, not wishes. Singed eyebrows are considered a rite of passage.
tick:
  arcana +2
  health -1

@state class_tidecalling
name: Elective: Tidecalling
kind: class
group: elective
art: wave
tags: class
desc: Lessons on the lake shore, bending water and patience in equal measure.
tick:
  arcana +1
  vigor +1
  mood +1

@state class_illusion
name: Elective: Illusion & Glamour
kind: class
group: elective
art: mask
tags: class
desc: The art of making people see what you want. Professor Vey insists it is not lying.
tick:
  guile +1
  charm +1

@state class_alchemy
name: Elective: Practical Alchemy
kind: class
group: elective
art: cauldron
tags: class
desc: Brewing, distilling and the occasional controlled explosion.
