# ---------------- Conditions ----------------

@state hungry
name: Hungry
kind: debuff
art: meal
duration: 1
desc: The board went unpaid this month. Bread rolls pocketed from the refectory only go so far.
tick:
  health -3
  mood -4
  say: {~Your stomach growls through every lecture.|Bread rolls in your pockets, and not enough of them.|You learn exactly how long a bowl of porridge lasts.}

@state sick
name: Lake Fever
kind: debuff
art: rain
duration: 2
desc: Shivers, sniffles and a nose that glows faintly blue.
tick:
  health -4
  mood -2
  say: {~You sniffle through the month, nose glowing faintly blue.|Shivers, tea and far too many handkerchiefs.}

@state injured
name: Injured
kind: debuff
art: cross
duration: 2
desc: Something is bruised, sprained or bent the wrong way.
tick:
  health -2
  vigor -1
  say: {~Every staircase reminds you where it hurts.|You limp, and the moving stairs show no sympathy.}

@state exhausted
name: Exhausted
kind: debuff
art: bed
duration: 1
desc: You could sleep standing up. You might have.
tick:
  health -3
  mood -3
  say: {~You yawn through a whole lecture without ever closing your mouth.|You could sleep standing up, and once you do.}

@state inspired
name: Inspired
kind: buff
art: sparkle
duration: 2
desc: Ideas arrive faster than you can write them down.
tick:
  lore +1
  arcana +1
  mood +2
  say: {~Ideas arrive faster than you can write them down.|You fill a notebook and start another.}

@state heartbroken
name: Heartbroken
kind: debuff
art: heartbreak
duration: 3
desc: Songs are suddenly about you. All of them.
tick:
  mood -4
  say: {~Every song in the common room is about you.|You walk the long way round, to miss a certain corridor.}

@state slacking
name: Skipping Classes
kind: debuff
art: bed
duration: 2
desc: Freedom! Also: falling behind.
tick:
  mood +2
  say: {~A free morning, a lie-in, a twinge of guilt.|You skip a lecture, and nobody seems to mind yet.}

@state detention
name: Detention
kind: debuff
art: lock
duration: 1
desc: Scrubbing cauldrons under the eye of a prefect.
tick:
  mood -3
  say: {~Cauldrons scrubbed under a prefect's eye.|Evenings in detention, smelling of old potion.}

@state probation
name: Academic Probation
kind: debuff
art: scales
desc: Your marks are below the line. Two terms under a 1.0 and the Disciplinary Board sits. A GPA of 2.0 clears it.
tick:
  mood -2
  if gpa >= 2.0:
    lose probation
  say: {~Probation sits on your shoulder through every lecture.|Your name is on a list you never wanted to be on.}

# Financial aid (playtest 2, X14): a term's grant from the bursar's hardship fund, or the bursar's own loan, which is
# gentler than Grisk's (no interest, no collectors; a missed month costs only mood and waits).
@state hardship_grant
name: Hardship Grant
kind: buff
art: scales
duration: 4
desc: The bursar's hardship fund pays 8 crowns a month for a term. The paperwork asked how poor you were, in detail.
tick:
  gold +8
  say: {~The hardship grant arrives in a brown envelope with your name spelled wrong.|Eight crowns from the fund, and a form to say you received them.}

@state bursar_loan
name: Bursar's Loan
kind: debuff
art: scales
desc: The academy lent you sixty crowns. It takes 8 a month when you can pay, seven times, then a last 4, with no interest and no collectors: only a very patient ledger.
tick:
  if loan_paid >= 7 and gold >= 4:
    gold -4
    loan_paid += 1
  elif loan_paid < 7 and gold >= 8:
    gold -8
    loan_paid += 1
  else:
    mood -1
    say: {~No loan payment this month. The bursar notes it without comment, which is its own comment.|The loan waits. The ledger is patient; you are less so.}
  if loan_paid >= 8:
    lose bursar_loan
    say: The bursar's loan is paid off. She stamps the ledger with something like a smile.

@state in_debt
name: Debt to Grisk
kind: debuff
art: chain
desc: The goblin moneylender takes 12 crowns a month until the debt is cleared. Ignore a missed payment and he adds another.
# Unpaid, the debt escalates (playtest 2, M22): the first miss brings a reminder (ignore it and a month is added),
# the next the collectors.
tick:
  if gold >= 12:
    gold -12
    debt_paid += 1
  else:
    mood -4
    debt_missed += 1
    if debt_missed == 1:
      queue grisk_reminder now
  if debt_paid >= 6:
    lose in_debt
  if debt_missed >= 2:
    queue grisk_collectors now

@state famous
