@state summer_away
name: Summer Away
kind: neutral
art: house
duration: 2
desc: Away from the academy for the summer recess. No rent, no classes.

@state summer_work
name: Summer Work
kind: job
art: coin
duration: 2
desc: A summer of honest (and occasionally dishonest) labour.
tick:
  gold +25
  health -2

@state frog_voice
name: Croaking
kind: debuff
art: frog
duration: 1
desc: A botched transfiguration left you with the voice of a bullfrog.
