desc: A student at the rival academy who writes you long, funny letters full of terrible gossip.
# Legacy (playtest 2, X9): the pen pal is now Tamsin (@npc tamsin) and their letters are cards; nothing grants this.

@state frost_ward
name: Ilse's Frost-Ward
kind: buff
art: snow
desc: A sliver of Northern winter that Ilse sewed into your collar. Cold things think twice about you.
tick:
  arcana +1
  health +1

# ---------------- Break plans (design §4.3; phase 2b) ----------------
# Chosen at the start of each break (calendar_2b.grim: break_plan). A plan lasts the break.

@state plan_castle
name: Break: at the castle
kind: plan
group: plan
duration: 2
art: tower
desc: A skeleton crew, empty corridors and secrets. Board costs 6 crowns a month.

@state plan_home
name: Break: at home
kind: plan
group: plan
duration: 2
art: house
tags: away
map_id: home
desc: Family, old friends and free board. The days are slower here.
on_add:
  gain summer_away 2

@state gig_grounds
name: Holiday gig: the grounds
group: gig
duration: 2
art: leaf
desc: Working the grounds for Old Maud this break. Good pay, sore hands.

@state gig_kitchens
name: Holiday gig: the kitchens
group: gig
duration: 2
art: meal
desc: Working the Refectory kitchens this break. Good pay, short temper.

# The holiday version of a term job (X15): for those at its top rank; its own pay, through its cards.
@state gig_library
name: Holiday gig: the stocktake
group: gig
duration: 2
art: book
desc: The library's holiday stocktake, for its senior clerks. Every book counted, every bite noted. Better pay than the baseline gigs.

@state gig_newt
name: Holiday gig: the Newt's holiday rush
group: gig
duration: 2
art: cup
desc: Running the Gilded Newt through the holiday rush, for its managers. The best tips of the year, and the longest nights.

@state gig_pell
name: Holiday gig: the remedy rush
group: gig
duration: 2
art: bottle
desc: Mixing the season's remedies at Pell & Daughters, for its assistant apothecaries. Good pay, and the village depends on it.

@state gig_post
name: Holiday gig: the holiday post
group: gig
duration: 2
art: letter
desc: Flying the holiday post for the courier loft, for its chief couriers. Every parcel in the valley, and the weather against you.

@state plan_work
name: Break: working full-time
kind: plan
group: plan
duration: 2
art: coin
desc: Working on campus through the break: a holiday gig, and board as usual. Tiring.

@state plan_internship
name: Break: internship
kind: plan
group: plan
duration: 2
art: book
tags: away
map_id: internship
desc: A research placement away from the castle, with a stipend and a supervisor.
tick: gold +6
# One summer each (M16): the supervisor's report (feedback 2026-10-15b) comes first, and a strong one brings an offer
# to come back; otherwise the post ends.
on_expire:
  queue intern_assessment

# ---------------- The midnight turn (playtest 2, M41) ----------------

@state locked_out
name: Confined After Dark
kind: debuff
duration: 3
art: lock
desc: Caught once too often. Your door is checked at midnight, and the night is closed to you.
